    <Placemark>
      <name>Aloha State Park</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/M-212_terminus.jpg/330px-M-212_terminus.jpg" width="320"/><br/><p>Aloha State Park is a public recreation area located six miles (9.7 km) south of Cheboygan in Cheboygan County, Michigan. The state park covers 172 acres (70 ha) on the northeast side of Mullett Lake at the center of the Inland Lakes Waterways.</p><p>County: Cheboygan</p><p><a href="https://www.michigan.gov/recsearch/parks/Aloha">More information</a></p>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#state_park</styleUrl>
