    <Placemark>
      <name>Muskallonge Lake State Park</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Muskallonge_Lake_State_Park_beach%2C_Muskallonge_Lake_%28June_2021%29.jpg/330px-Muskallonge_Lake_State_Park_beach%2C_Muskallonge_Lake_%28June_2021%29.jpg" width="320"/><br/><p>Muskallonge Lake State Park is a state park located in Luce County in the U.S. state of Michigan. It is located in Deer Park about 16 miles (25.7 km) east of Grand Marais along H-58.</p><p>County: Luce</p><p><a href="https://www.michigan.gov/recsearch/parks/Muskallonge">More information</a></p>]]></description>
