    <Placemark>
      <name>Craig Lake State Park</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Craig Lake State Park is a remote public recreation area covering 9,732 acres (3,938 ha) in Baraga County in the Upper Peninsula of the state of Michigan. The state park has several lakes that are accessible only by foot or paddling.</p><p>County: Baraga</p><p><a href="https://www.michigan.gov/recsearch/parks/CraigLake">More information</a></p>]]></description>
