      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Wagner_Falls.jpg/330px-Wagner_Falls.jpg" width="320"/><br/><p>The Wagner Falls Scenic Site is a Michigan State Park, located in central Alger County, Upper Michigan. The 23-acre (0.1 km2) state scenic area protects Wagner Falls.</p><p>County: Alger</p><p><a href="https://www.michigan.gov/recsearch/parks/WagnerFalls">More information</a></p>]]></description>
