    <Placemark>
      <name>Straits State Park</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Straits_State_Park_bridge_view_%28November_2019%29.jpg/330px-Straits_State_Park_bridge_view_%28November_2019%29.jpg" width="320"/><br/><p>Straits State Park is a state park in the U.S. state of Michigan located in Moran Township and St. Ignace in Mackinac County on the northern shores of the Straits of Mackinac. The Father Marquette National Memorial and park is also located within the state park boundaries. The park has 255 campsites and several locations for viewing the Mackinac Bridge.</p><p>County: Mackinac</p><p><a href="https://www.michigan.gov/recsearch/parks/Straits">More information</a></p>]]></description>
